# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DOMAIN CONVENTION — this file is the production (all-modes) configuration:
# every public URL uses the production domain swsdf.sa. Development overrides
# live in .env.development and use the local gateway domain swsdf.test.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API ENDPOINTS NAMING CONVENTION GUIDE
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Recommended Pattern: VITE_{MODULE}_{ENTITY}_{ACTION}
# See: docs_website/v3/api-endpoints-naming-convention.md for full details
# 
# Migration Notes:
# - Each line below has a comment showing the recommended name
# - Update gradually during refactoring to avoid breaking errors
# - Keep both old and new variables until migration is complete
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BASE URLS
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_APP_API_URL="https://swsdf.almotamayiz.com/api"  # Legacy - use VITE_API_BASE_URL
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://swsdf.almotamayiz.com/api"  # Legacy - use VITE_API_BASE_URL
VITE_APP_API_URL="https://swsdf.sa/api"  # Recommended: VITE_API_BASE_URL
VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://swsdf.sa/api"  # ✓ Recommended
VITE_WEB_BASE_URL="https://swsdf.sa/"  # ✓ Recommended
VITE_WEB_BASE_URL="https://swsdf.sa/"  # Duplicate - remove
VITE_BASE_URL="/"  # Legacy - use VITE_WEB_BASE_URL or VITE_MEDIA_BASE_URL

VITE_MEDIA_BASE_URL="/"  # ✓ Recommended
VITE_FILES_BASE_URL="/"  # ✓ Recommended for files.path values returned by API

VITE_API_URL="https://swsdf.sa/api/"  # ✓ Recommended
VITE_API_FASTUPLOAD_URL="https://swsdf.sa/api/"
